enc.aspx"},{"c":"BOKF 2018 Q4","e":"bokf","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nell","x":"We have worked the past few quarters to rightsize expenses, and to that end we are down $2.2 million in ongoing expense year-over-year, and down nearly 20% in personnel staffing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/bok-financial-corp-bokf-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"BOKF 2018 Q4","e":"bokf","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stacy C. Kymes","x":"We do think that as we move into '19, as those large players kind of rightsize, sell properties out of collateral pools and things like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/bok-financial-corp-bokf-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"BOKF 2019 Q1","e":"bokf","d":"2019-04-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nell","x":"Well, I actually think we will pass through 60% sometime in the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/bok-financial-corp-bokf-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"BOKF 2019 Q1","e":"bokf","d":"2019-04-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nell","x":"I really think we reach that mark and pass through it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/bok-financial-corp-bokf-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"BOKF 2019 Q1","e":"bokf","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nell","x":"We have worked the past few quarters to rightsize expenses and with rate hikes subsiding, these efforts have been rewarded with better operating leverage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/bok-financial-corp-bokf-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"BOKF 2019 Q2","e":"bokf","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nell","x":"Increased operating leverage in the segment from our rightsizing efforts continues to pay dividends